### Record an expense (paidByUserId omitted = you)
POST {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444441",
  "amountMinor": 50000,
  "currency": "IDR",
  "category": "FOOD",
  "paymentMethod": "E_WALLET",
  "note": "Nasi campur",
  "spentAt": "2026-11-20T05:00:00Z"
}

### Foreign currency: USD 10.00 at 1 USD = 16000 IDR
POST {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444442",
  "amountMinor": 1000,
  "currency": "USD",
  "fxRateToBase": "16000",
  "category": "SHOPPING",
  "spentAt": "2026-11-20T18:00:00Z"
}

### Shares that do not add up -> 422 SPLIT_TOTAL_MISMATCH
POST {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444443",
  "amountMinor": 100,
  "currency": "IDR",
  "spentAt": "2026-11-20T05:00:00Z",
  "splits": [ { "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001", "shareMinor": 60 } ]
}

### List (newest first, splits included)
GET {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Summary (base currency, days in Asia/Jakarta)
GET {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/expenses/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete (soft)
DELETE {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/expenses/44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444441
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
